sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Main UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Tool as Task Tools
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>UI: Type "Add gym at 7 PM"
    UI->>API: POST /agent/message
    API->>Graph: tenant_id + message
    Graph->>Tool: create_task(tenant_id, title, time)
    Tool->>DB: insert into tasks
    Tool->>DB: insert into task_logs
    DB-->>Tool: saved task
    Tool-->>Graph: created task
    Graph-->>API: response + task state
    API-->>UI: JSON response
    UI-->>User: Show "Added gym at 7 PM"
